<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-11T22:53:08.679Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb attacks in southern Thailand injured students and prompted police to step up border security across multiple provinces, while Perlis authorities increased vigilance. Thai forces deployed F-16s to the Tak border as clashes in Myanmar spilled across the frontier, and Thailand placed ten border provinces on alert and prepared evacuation centres for potential refugees. Talks began between Thailand and Myanmar to address arsenic-tainted rivers, and Mae Sai residents demanded action on cross-border water contamination. The insurgency killed an insurgent trainer and a suspect in Yala operations near Malaysia, and a separate Yala action killed another insurgent. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOc1BXOXBja0w1c09oeTZ1WVhVN0dGbHF0Um9aVDV5MTE1T3hvMXg0RnVWM0twaGNLZXR1ODBhMDN6U2VySWJjY0ZPd0dfOVlONDhvMjZNN3BPZWJYdE1DSi1xY0QtbG43eHNkelM0RkJodjFXaHc3RHBmU3lQZC1fT294Mk5sMEhGaDJlLWlGYmtGQkdpWVFwMHFDeWhIT1Z6XzV1Q1B4b0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUEp0U1dzM1B4Zkh1bnVhYkVaWVRGODNYMW02dWVEOE44OTN0dHRLVjIteTE4TUlQVW0wWVVxajEwR0M4U3U5WkFEX09aMEVRSFJ3aVJralRBcTZaNUlCTi1lWjliZ2c1LXpmMUVpbUhjOGFfV0llUEdtWWJRNjIta1ZGeG9hQ2NPNGVUTGZQakw4QTIyUmZTcnNvVXZuMl9Xc09QdERlM3k0ZkFzTEQ3OU5KeXgyZVd4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVDNWLXVDUkpjcGgz